			"notes": "* Update to 1.21.1 minecraft version\n* The Book of The Legends now have a little description about his usage and indicate amount of pages was have and missing.\n* The echo ore generation of Flutter Echo now is incompatible with Silk Touch. \n* The echo ores now it's compatible with modded ores if they use vanilla tags.\n* The echo ores now use vanilla loot table. Before used a custom loot table.\n* Fixed the error when add a new page to Book of The Legends advise two messages.\n* Little changes for texts and translations.\n* Added advancements\n* Sparkle items for Reliquary now use tags.\n* Echo Ability now works fine on servers.\n* Added compatibility with Mythic Metals.\n* The lock particle now should be disappeared with reliquary.\n* The Reliquary now is unbreakable if is locked.\n* All enchantments have been deleted.\n* Improvements in how works the rune table.\n* Fabric Shield Lib no longer needed"
		},
