			"notes": "## 4.0.0\n* New Structure: Forest Hut. Has 2 variants: one what spawn in forest and other what spawn in taigas.\n* New Items: Blank Rune, Blank Blueprint, Death Rune Page, Time Rune Page, Sky Rune Page, Reliquary Page, Emerald Mourning Page, Swallows Storm Page, Flutter Echo Page, Vengeance Enchantment Page.\n* New Block: Rune Table.\n* New Enchantment: Vengeance.\n* Added Rune Table. Can craft runes and enchantments in it.\n* The Book of The Legends now can be obtained into the Forest Hut.\n* Now Reliquary need tool to break and is immune to explosions.\n* The Reliquary now accept golden and diamonds tools, weapons and armor.\n* The lock particle now disappear with the Reliquary.\n* The Reliquary sends a message with is locked.\n* The Reliquary no longer interacts with the hoppers.\n* Now the projectile of Flutter Echo has more duration in relation the amount counts of targets.\n* Fixed the crash when use Flutter Echo Awake ability and closed the server before what echo block disappear.\n* Echo Block now appear in the creative inventory tab.\n* Now you can found pages of Old Legends items in the cartographer structure of villages.\n* The velocity of Mourning Mob increase of 0.3 to 0.8.\n* Emerald Mourning Awake: Time of Revenge now summon 4 mobs instead 3."
		},
